sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant OCSP as OCSP Service (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: The configured eMAID is known by the CSMS as valid
    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: The contract certificate is signed by the configured<br>V2GRoot or MORoot certificate at the CSMS
    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: Contract certificate has a responder URL that points<br>to an OCSP service for Test System
    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: CSMS does not have a cached OCSP response<br>for the contract certificate
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State: State is EVConnectedPreSession

    CS->>CSMS: AuthorizeRequest (idToken.idToken = <Configured valid_idtoken_idtoken>, idToken.type = <Configured valid_idtoken_type>, iso15118CertificateHashData absent, certificate from keystore)

    CSMS->>OCSP: OCSP request to responder URL of certificate to check validity
    Note over CSMS: Validation: CSMS sends an OCSP request for certificate

    OCSP-->>CSMS: OCSP response (certificate is valid)
    Note over OCSP: Validation: Test System checks that received request for certificate is valid<br>AND key type = ECDSA<br>AND certificate chain contains at least one subCA

    CSMS-->>CS: AuthorizeResponse (idTokenInfo.status = Accepted, certificateStatus = Accepted)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: idTokenInfo.status Accepted<br>certificateStatus Accepted

    CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (triggerReason = Authorized)
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse (idTokenInfo.status = Accepted)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: idTokenInfo.status Accepted

    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State EnergyTransferStarted

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
